	)
	(text "U3801-U3804 sense DDR_RAW/DDR1V35, ANA5_RAW/ANA5,\nPHY_RAW/PHY1V05 and ANA33_RAW/ANA3V3 across upstream shunts.\nMON_I_* outputs report forward current; MON_V_* outputs report half\nthe post-shunt rail voltage. AON supplies all four monitors."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 68.3 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "2507fed6-44de-4acf-94c6-30ffc3d32eb6")
	)
	(text "DDR: 10 mOhm, 0.2 V/A, trip 4 A. PHY: 20 mOhm, 0.4 V/A, trip 2 A.\nANA5 and ANA3V3: 50 mOhm, 1 V/A, trip 0.8 A. LIMIT is nominally 0.8 V;\nItrip = 0.8 V / (20 x Rshunt). Review the DDR trip against its 3 A converter.\nCurrent RC: 1 kOhm / 10 nF, 10 us; voltage RC: 10k || 10k / 10 nF, 50 us."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 114.02 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "254e1718-b36c-4252-95c6-89fefdda9655")
	)
	(text "Ethernet PHY 1.05 V core supply"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 86.36 26.67 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 0 70 190 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "740966bf-b0ef-4e6b-9f86-45b88e5a3228")
	)
	(text "BAT54S clamps each voltage node to GND and AON; 10 kOhm resistors\nlimit the injected current. ANA5 current includes the downstream ANA3V3\nload. These monitors report faults; they do not interrupt power locally.\nQualify all readings with AON availability and the commanded rail state."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 156.21 136.88 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(thickness 0.15)
				(color 33 43 55 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "7a163bec-f87c-4c66-805d-a2eead513ec9")
	)
